     "html": "<p>Hi {{ contact.firstname }},</p>\n<div data-block-id=\"block-1b650049-baea-4309-ac66-f28753056020\">\n<p>Still thinking about providing high quality chewable supplements to your customers? Here are a few more detailed insights into the benefits and options available for private labeling chewables:</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Customer Appeal:</strong> Chewables are ideal for customers who prefer a convenient and tasty way to take their supplements. Their pleasant taste and ease of use encourage regular consumption, leading to repeat purchases and increased customer loyalty.<br><br></li>\n<li><strong>Versatility:</strong> Chewables cater to a wide range of age groups and health needs. From children who enjoy the taste to adults looking for convenience, chewables provide a versatile option for your product line.<br><br></li>\n<li><strong>Branded Supplements:</strong> By partnering with our design experts at <span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span>, your business can provide chewable supplements with unique labels that reflect your brand.<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<p>By offering a variety of high-quality chewable supplements, you can cater to the diverse needs of your customers, ensuring they receive the best results possible and boosting your business\u2019s profitability.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Don't forget to check out our entire selection of chewable supplements <a href=\"https://www.praxerasupplements.com/\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a>. If you have any questions about chewables, other supplement types or private labeling in general, feel free to <a href=\"https://www.praxerasupplements.com/en/pl-demo-get-started\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\" rel=\"noopener\">reach out</a>!</p>\n</div>",
     "module_id": 1155639
    },
